    {
      "id": "O-4OI5VNc-TMBb_QGAcfT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -14.872461341676285,
      "y": 2349.1816294306805,
      "width": 1026.778076171875,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1527304440,
      "version": 717,
      "versionNonce": 1431753803,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788610768494,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Performing quantization to go from float32 to float16 is straightforward --> both data types follow\nthe same representation scheme",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Performing quantization to go from float32 to float16 is straightforward --> both data types follow the same representation scheme",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "R3XTaXsaMObcrCXFaVbK2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 280.10049486160256,
      "y": 2532.827819506327,
      "width": 285.5451965332031,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1927160200,
      "version": 518,
      "versionNonce": 165840267,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788610782426,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Quantization to int8\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Quantization to int8\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "x5jc1Yxt0a7gwMufGrbDT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 42.84182437260938,
      "y": 2633.987820307413,
      "width": 1026.778076171875,
      "height": 800,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1555083400,
      "version": 1738,
      "versionNonce": 1093146379,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788613731306,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Performing quantization to go from float32 to int8 is more tricky. How do we go from [-1, 1] to [-128,\n127]?\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe mapping funcotin which converts float to int is also called quantization scheme.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe range in which we are going to quantize is called clipping range. In some quantization schemes the\nfirst value is also dropped to have a symmetric interval. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Performing quantization to go from float32 to int8 is more tricky. How do we go from [-1, 1] to [-128, 127]?\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe mapping funcotin which converts float to int is also called quantization scheme.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe range in which we are going to quantize is called clipping range. In some quantization schemes the first value is also dropped to have a symmetric interval. ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ar8YgqOQ0wsXiJU85EwXY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 426.5518479347227,
      "y": 4463.0102314949045,
      "width": 142.8006134033203,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
